---
title: Honor configured ignore field, skip toml files by default, deduplicate headers
author: balqaasem
pr: 18

doc:
  - audience: Developer
    description: |
      The walker now honors the configured `ignore` field (renamed from `skip`; the
      legacy `skip` key still works as an alias). TOML files are skipped by default,
      while `Cargo.toml` is still processed for its `license` field. Applying headers
      now detects stale license headers anywhere in a file and replaces them instead
      of stacking a new header on top, so headers are never duplicated.

crates:
  - name: forehead-cli
    bump: patch
  - name: forehead-core
    bump: patch